# path.log — the model path, not the shining path.
# An unbroken log is the model path. A broken log is the shining path. The model path is the higher level.
# The walk as actually walked: one entry per change, oldest at the top,
# newest appended at the bottom, never rewritten. Each entry carries the
# meters where they were taken; older entries predate the meters and say so.
# Format:
# YYYY-MM-DD | <commit> | <files> | <what> | qual <b>-><a> | health <b>-><a> | tests <pass>/<fail> | verse <held|warmed|cooled: before -> after>
# The verse field starts 2026-10-02 and is for a .h. A landed day is major when that header is in the diff, and minor when only the .c moved. Older lines omit the verse and the class.
# Each run appends, including a run that lands no change. The same date may hold more than one line. Commit is `-`. Meters not taken are `n/a`.
